8-3","title":"A solid-phase enzyme-linked immunospot (ELISPOT) assay for enumeration of specific antibody-secreting cells.","authorString":"Czerkinsky CC, Nilsson LA, Nygren H, Ouchterlony O, Tarkowski A.","authorList":{"author":[{"fullName":"Czerkinsky CC","lastName":"Czerkinsky","firstName":"C C","initials":"CC"},{"fullName":"Nilsson LA","lastName":"Nilsson","firstName":"L A","initials":"LA"},{"fullName":"Nygren H","lastName":"Nygren","firstName":"H","initials":"H"},{"fullName":"Ouchterlony O","lastName":"Ouchterlony","firstName":"O","initials":"O"},{"fullName":"Tarkowski A","lastName":"Tarkowski","firstName":"A","initials":"A"}]},"dataLinksTagsList":{"dataLinkstag":["wikipedia"]},"journalInfo":{"issue":"1-2","volume":"65","journalIssueId":584415,"dateOfPublication":"1983 Dec","monthOfPublication":12,"yearOfPublication":1983,"journal":{"medlineAbbreviation":"J Immunol Methods","title":"Journal of immunological methods","essn":"1872-7905","issn":"0022-1759","nlmid":"1305440","isoabbreviation":"J Immunol Methods"},"printPublicationDate":"1983-12-01"},"pubYear":"1983","pageInfo":"109-121","abstractText":"A solid-phase enzyme-linked immunosorbent assay (ELISPOT) is described for enumeration of cells secreting specific antibody. Spleen cells from immunized mice are incubated in antigen-coated polystyrene plates. After removal of the cells, bound antibodies are demonstrated by means of an immunoenzyme procedure in which enzyme-substrate reactions are performed in agarose. Dark-brown circular zones (spots), localized in areas of the dish where antibody production has occurred, are enumerated with the naked eye. Spectrophotometric estimation of enzyme-bound activity may be performed by substituting the gel for a liquid buffer, allowing accurate estimation of the total amount of secreted antibody. Versatile, sensitive and very easy to perform, this new assay provides a useful alternative to conventional plaque-forming cell assays.","publicationStatus":"ppublish","language":"eng","pubModel":"Print","pubTypeList":{"pubType":["Comparative Study","Research Support, Non-U.S. Gov't","Journal Article"]},"meshHeadingList":{"meshHeading":[{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Spleen","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"majorTopic_YN":"N","abbreviation":"CY","qualifierName":"cytology"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","abbreviation":"IM","qualifierName":"immunology"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","descriptorName":"Antibody-Producing Cells","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"majorTopic_YN":"N","abbreviation":"IM","qualifierName":"immunology"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Fetal Blood","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"majorTopic_YN":"N","abbreviation":"IM","qualifierName":"immunology"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Animals"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Mice, Inbred C57BL"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Mice"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Ovalbumin","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"majorTopic_YN":"N","abbreviation":"IM","qualifierName":"immunology"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Antigens","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"majorTopic_YN":"N","abbreviation":"IM","qualifierName":"immunology"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Culture Media"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Hemolytic Plaque Technique"},{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","descriptorName":"Immunoenzyme Techniques"},{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","descriptorName":"Enzyme-Linked Immunosorbent Assay"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Cell Count"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Antibody Specificity"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Kinetics"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Female"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Male"},{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","descriptorName":"Hemocyanins"}]},"chemicalList":{"chemical":[{"name":"Antigens","registryNumber":"0"},{"name":"Culture Media","registryNumber":"0"},{"name":"Ovalbumin","registryNumber":"9006-59-1"},{"name":"keyhole-limpet hemocyanin","registryNumber":"FV4Y0JO2CX"},{"name":"Hemocyanins","registryNumber":"9013-72-3"}]},"subsetList":{"subset":[{"code":"IM","name":"Index Medicus"}]},"fullTextUrlList":{"fullTextUrl":[{"availability":"Subscription required","availabilityCode":"S","documentStyle":"doi","site":"DOI","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/0022-1759(83)90308-3"}]},"isOpenAccess":"N","inEPMC":"N","inPMC":"N","citedByCount":746,"hasReferences":"Y","hasTextMinedTerms":"Y","hasDbCrossReferences":"N","hasPDF":"N","hasBook":"N","hasSuppl":"N","hasLabsLinks":"Y","hasData":"N","authMan":"N","epmcAuthMan":"N","nihAuthMan":"N","hasTMAccessionNumbers":"N","dateOfCompletion":"1984-02-14","dateOfCreation":"1983-12-16","dateOfRevision":"2020-12-22","firstPublicationDate":"1983-12-01","firstIndexDate":"2008-01-29","hasEvaluations":"N"},{"id":"6381602","source":"MED","pmid":"6381602","doi":"10.1016/0022-1759(84)90013-9","title":"Solid-phase enzyme-linked immunospot (ELISPOT) assay for enumeration of IgG rheumatoid factor-secreting cells.","authorString":"Tarkowski A, Czerkinsky C, Nilsson LA, Nygren H, Ouchterlony O.","authorList":{"author":[{"fullName":"Tarkowski A","lastName":"Tarkowski","firstName":"A","initials":"A"},{"fullName":"Czerkinsky C","lastName":"Czerkinsky","firstName":"C","initials":"C"},{"fullName":"Nilsson LA","lastName":"Nilsson","firstName":"L A","initials":"LA"},{"fullName":"Nygren H","lastName":"Nygren","firstName":"H","initials":"H"},{"fullName":"Ouchterlony O","lastName":"Ouchterlony","firstName":"O","initials":"O"}]},"journalInfo":{"issue":"2","volume":"72","journalIssueId":641455,"dateOfPublication":"1984 Sep","monthOfPublication":9,"yearOfPublication":1984,"journal":{"medlineAbbreviation":"J Immunol Methods","title":"Journal of immunological methods","essn":"1872-7905","issn":"0022-1759","nlmid":"1305440","isoabbreviation":"J Immunol Methods"},"printPublicationDate":"1984-09-01"},"pubYear":"1984","pageInfo":"451-459","abstractText":"Although IgG rheumatoid factor may play an essential role in the pathogenesis of rheumatoid arthritis, there is no precise method for its specific detection at the cellular level. A modification of the recently developed enzyme-linked immunospot assay has been devised for enumeration of cells secreting IgG rheumatoid factor (IgG RF) and simultaneous quantitation of the IgG RF secreted. Specific, sensitive and simple, this new assay should provide a valuable tool for study of isotype-specific RF secretion by single cells.","publicationStatus":"ppublish","language":"eng","pubModel":"Print","pubTypeList":{"pubType":["Research Support, Non-U.S. Gov't","Journal Article"]},"meshHeadingList":{"meshHeading":[{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Spleen","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"majorTopic_YN":"N","abbreviation":"CY","qualifierName":"cytology"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Antibody-Producing Cells","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","abbreviation":"ME","qualifierName":"metabolism"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Animals"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Mice, Inbred BALB C"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Mice, Inbred C57BL"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Mice"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Autoimmune Diseases","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"majorTopic_YN":"N","abbreviation":"IM","qualifierName":"immunology"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Immunoglobulin G","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"majorTopic_YN":"N","abbreviation":"AN","qualifierName":"analysis"},{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","abbreviation":"BI","qualifierName":"biosynthesis"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Rheumatoid Factor","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","abbreviation":"BI","qualifierName":"biosynthesis"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Leukocyte Count"},{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","descriptorName":"Immunoenzyme Techniques"},{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","descriptorName":"Enzyme-Linked Immunosorbent Assay"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descri